What?!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.580
Have you decided on an answer?

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.830
Tch! What a nasty bastard.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:05.950
We will not hand our iDOLs over to you.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:08.870
No matter how many times you ask,
the answer won't change.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:12.910
Regardless of how many times
we display our power?

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:15.830
Commence the operation.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:21.160
"We will not negotiate with Turiavita."
That is our set policy.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:22.700
Have you traced him yet?

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:23.330
That is most problematic.
Have you traced him yet?

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.330
That is most problematic.
N-not yet.

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.410
I must apologize,

00:15:27.410 --> 00:15:31.620
but soon you won't be able to lay
so much as a finger on our iDOLs.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.910
That's true no matter who you are.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.620
I see. Are you planning to hide the iDOLs?

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.790
Like in imaginary space?

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:45.450
Everyone, please proceed
with your respective plans.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:46.120
It's clear!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:48.200
Be careful not to push yourselves too hard.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.120
Hey, don't push me!
Be careful not to push yourselves too hard.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.500
C'mon! Get a move on.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:55.870
What are you doing?!

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:57.250
Jeez! Pick up the pace!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:04.080
Sweet! No one is in here.
Quickly get this up and running!

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:05.080
Roger!

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.870
Miss Naze, please handle things here.

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:09.870
Sir, where are you going?

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:13.370
Not to fear. I just have
a personal matter to attend to.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.580
Imaginary space? What ever do you mean?

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.120
Even a child could anticipate this move.

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:24.290
Aside from sealing the cores,
you have no options left before you.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:31.160
But even the ingenious Lo-wu couple
were unable to control imaginary space.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.750
There is no way you can see
this through to fruition.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.870
In the end, your excellent staff
is nothing more than riff-raff.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:46.750
There! I'm done on my end.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.450
I'm almost done.

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.620
Wait a sec. I'm almost-

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:53.500
You there! What are you doing?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:55.950
Raise your hands and get away
from the computers.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.330
Huh? Wait!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.500
Naraba?!

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:04.700
As the director said, as a man,
I can't touch or directly protect an iDOL!

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.000
But I'm also a member of the iDOL Team!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.750
At the very least, I can be your shield!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.410
You bastard!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:21.290
D-Dr. Hotaru?

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:23.750
Hurry with your work.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.700
The time left has grown limited.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.200
That goes for you as well as for us.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:36.000
We no longer have time
for such meaningless resistance.

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:40.200
Did you trace him?

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:43.200
It didn't work!
They deflected all of our attacks.

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:46.080
He's taking advantage of our weaknesses.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:48.700
What now?!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.750
Contact headquarters immediately.
We're missing three of our guards!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:57.330
Wh-what?!

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.410
It won't open!

00:18:03.910 --> 00:18:05.040
What's going on?!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:12.040
Go!

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.040
The counter-attack...

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:18.330
...has begun!

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:22.750
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:23.750
I'm sorry...

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.870
The intruders are hacking
our facility's system.

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:30.290
You really are good for nothing
but being a shield...

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.200
One of my good points is my durability.

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:34.950
They are breaking our units
into groups and isolating them.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:40.200
Subdue them immediately!
You have permission to fire.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:41.870
Shoot upon spotting-

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:42.790
Wait.

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:45.790
If sealing them in
imaginary space is impossible,

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.700
there is no point in staying here any longer.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.660
Huh? B-but...

00:18:50.000 --> 00:18:50.750
F-freeze!

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:51.750
Besides...

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:56.830
I am most sorry,
but I need you to step aside.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.410
...I already have an idea
what these intruders are after.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.080
Prometheus 2 has activated!

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:26.410
I have confirmed that that we are receiving
system interference from the iDOL.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.410
It's no use! I can't keep up with them!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.450
They have taken over all of our systems!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:33.370
It's time to pull back.

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:34.500
But no big.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.120
This is just until I play my next hand.

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:40.580
This operation is over. Pull out all
of the units that can still move.

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.040
Sir, please wait!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.750
C'mon! Hurry! Hurry!

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:48.700
Huh...?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.830
No one's here?

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:55.040
What gives? They're pulling out?

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:58.410
It's over?

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.120
Maybe?

00:20:03.910 --> 00:20:05.660
Going home so soon?

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.160
Jeez, your team really is fantastic.
You all are.

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.950
I humbly accept your compliment.

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:19.830
Or so I would like to say, but you seem
to have given up rather easily.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:22.830
What was that one old movie line?

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:27.370
"If your sword is too sharp, it will last
the longest if you keep it sheathed."

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:28.700
Then it will dull.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:31.540
I would answer your question now.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:37.000
"Aulyn" appears when all of
the iDOLs are together.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.950
It will destroy the world with
the disaster filled inside it.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:47.080
The five iDOLs are the "keys"
needed to release Aulyn.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.790
Yay! It's Tempestas.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.500
It's okay. There aren't any
abnormalities with the core.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:53.160
Thank goodness...

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.250
We're going to start making the
adjustments right away!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.000
Anyone free, go to the warehouse
and check on our supplies.

00:20:58.000 --> 00:20:58.870
Got it!

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.620
Isn't this great?
Your Nebula is safe and sound.

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:05.250
Yep. Now it's your turn.

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:13.200
Uh-huh! There is still something I can do...

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.910
No, there is something that I MUST do.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:19.370
Ow, ow, ow!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.080
In any event,
if we don't hand over the iDOLs,

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:25.410
Turiavita's next move will be
to attack us in earnest.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:27.950
There is no pulling back now.

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:33.200
After all, you have placed your hands
on Pandora's box of your own free will.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:52.950
Please wait for me, Imber...

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:05.370
Toki o wataru seija no you ni

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:14.370
Donna kodoku ni naite ita no?

00:22:14.370 --> 00:22:23.250
Haruka tooi hoshi o tsunagi

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:31.790
Ne, omoi o egaku wa, sora o miagete

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:43.250
Dear boy, itsumo kokoro ni anata o sagaseba

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:52.200
Ah, dakishimeru hodo ni tsuyoi hikari o hanatsu no

00:22:52.200 --> 00:23:01.160
Mabataku kidou ga futari no mejirushi

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:12.750
Ima doko de mite ite mo truth kanjitete

00:23:26.080 --> 00:23:41.080
Preview:

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:28.620
The basics on how to use a bat.

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:30.080
First off, keep your chest puffed out.

00:23:30.080 --> 00:23:30.540
Okay!
First off, keep your chest puffed out.

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:33.330
Keep your shoulders even
and bring your left leg forward.

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:33.870
Okay!
Keep your shoulders even
and bring your left leg forward.

00:23:33.870 --> 00:23:36.830
Put your weight on your left leg as if you're
going to bring your right leg forward.

00:23:36.830 --> 00:23:38.120
And swing, aiming at the man's head.

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:39.830
Don't go for his head! Go for the ball!
